The page's note says Shawn Nunley, the CSOH founder, was the Novell network administrator who set the voicemail trap in this chain. For the full story, including how the government's primary witness became one of Mitnick's closest friends, it points to the Kevin Mitnick In Memoriam tribute on this site.

